{
    "chapter_num": 12,
    "verses_count": 40,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The Growth of David’s Army"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now these "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the men who came to David at Ziklag while he was still a fugitive from Saul the son of Kish; and they "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " among the mighty men, helpers in the war, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "armed with bows, using both the right hand and the left in "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "hurling"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " stones and "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "shooting"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " arrows with the bow. "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "They were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of Benjamin, Saul’s brethren."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "The chief "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Ahiezer, then Joash, the sons of "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Or Hasmaah"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Shemaah the Gibeathite; Jeziel and Pelet the sons of Azmaveth; Berachah, and Jehu the Anathothite; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Ishmaiah the Gibeonite, a mighty man among the thirty, and over the thirty; Jeremiah, Jahaziel, Johanan, and Jozabad the Gederathite; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Eluzai, Jerimoth, Bealiah, Shemariah, and Shephatiah the Haruphite; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Elkanah, Jisshiah, Azarel, Joezer, and Jashobeam, the Korahites; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "and Joelah and Zebadiah the sons of Jeroham of Gedor."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "Some"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Gadites "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. separated themselves to"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "joined David at the stronghold in the wilderness, mighty men of valor, men trained for battle, who could handle shield and spear, whose faces "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were like"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the faces of lions, and "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " as swift as gazelles on the mountains: "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Ezer the first, Obadiah the second, Eliab the third, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Mishmannah the fourth, Jeremiah the fifth, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Attai the sixth, Eliel the seventh, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Johanan the eighth, Elzabad the ninth, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Jeremiah the tenth, and Machbanai the eleventh. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "These "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " from the sons of Gad, captains of the army; the least was over a hundred, and the greatest was over a thousand. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "These "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "are"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the ones who crossed the Jordan in the first month, when it had overflowed all its banks; and they put to flight all "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "those"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " in the valleys, to the east and to the west."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then some of the sons of Benjamin and Judah came to David at the stronghold. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 17,
                    "num_str": "17",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And David went out "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. before them"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "to meet them, and answered and said to them, “If you have come peaceably to me to help me, my heart will be united with you; but if to betray me to my enemies, since "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "there is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " no "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. violence"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "wrong in my hands, may the God of our fathers look and bring judgment.” "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 18,
                    "num_str": "18",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then the Spirit "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. clothed"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "came upon Amasai, chief of the captains, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "and he said:"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "“"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "We are"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " yours, O David;"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "We "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "are"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " on your side, O son of Jesse!"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Peace, peace to you,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And peace to your helpers!"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For your God helps you.”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So David received them, and made them captains of the troop."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 19,
                    "num_str": "19",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "some"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " from Manasseh defected to David when he was going with the Philistines to battle against Saul; but they did not help them, for the lords of the Philistines sent him away by agreement, saying, “He may defect to his master Saul "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "and endanger"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " our heads.” "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 20,
                    "num_str": "20",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "When he went to Ziklag, those of Manasseh who defected to him were Adnah, Jozabad, Jediael, Michael, Jozabad, Elihu, and Zillethai, captains of the thousands who "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " from Manasseh. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 21,
                    "num_str": "21",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And they helped David against the bands "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "of raiders,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " for they "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " all mighty men of valor, and they were captains in the army. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 22,
                    "num_str": "22",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For at "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "that"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " time they came to David day by day to help him, until "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "it was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " a great army, like the army of God."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "David’s Army at Hebron"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 23,
                    "num_str": "23",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now these "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the numbers of the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. heads of those"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "divisions "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "that were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " equipped for war, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "and"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " came to David at Hebron to turn "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "over"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the kingdom of Saul to him, according to the word of the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": ": "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 24,
                    "num_str": "24",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "of the sons of Judah bearing shield and spear, six thousand eight hundred "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "equipped"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "armed for war; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 25,
                    "num_str": "25",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "of the sons of Simeon, mighty men of valor fit for war, seven thousand one hundred; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 26,
                    "num_str": "26",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "of the sons of Levi four thousand six hundred; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 27,
                    "num_str": "27",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Jehoiada, the leader of the Aaronites, and with him three thousand seven hundred; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 28,
                    "num_str": "28",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Zadok, a young man, a valiant warrior, and from his father’s house twenty-two captains; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 29,
                    "num_str": "29",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "of the sons of Benjamin, relatives of Saul, three thousand (until then the greatest part of them had remained loyal to the house of Saul); "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 30,
                    "num_str": "30",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "of the sons of Ephraim twenty thousand eight hundred, mighty men of valor, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. men of names"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "famous men throughout their father’s house; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 31,
                    "num_str": "31",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "of the half-tribe of Manasseh eighteen thousand, who were designated by name to come and make David king; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 32,
                    "num_str": "32",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "of the sons of Issachar who had understanding of the times, to know what Israel ought to do, their chiefs were two hundred; and all their brethren were at their command; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 33,
                    "num_str": "33",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "of Zebulun there were fifty thousand who went out to battle, expert in war with all weapons of war, stouthearted men who could keep ranks; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 34,
                    "num_str": "34",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "of Naphtali one thousand captains, and with them thirty-seven thousand with shield and spear; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 35,
                    "num_str": "35",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "of the Danites who could keep battle formation, twenty-eight thousand six hundred; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 36,
                    "num_str": "36",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "of Asher, those who could go out to war, able to keep battle formation, forty thousand; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 37,
                    "num_str": "37",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "of the Reubenites and the Gadites and the half-tribe of Manasseh, from the other side of the Jordan, one hundred and twenty thousand armed for battle with every "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "kind"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of weapon of war."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 38,
                    "num_str": "38",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "All these men of war, who could keep ranks, came to Hebron with a loyal heart, to make David king over all Israel; and all the rest of Israel "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of one mind to make David king. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 39,
                    "num_str": "39",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And they were there with David three days, eating and drinking, for their brethren had prepared for them. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 40,
                    "num_str": "40",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Moreover those who were near to them, from as far away as Issachar and Zebulun and Naphtali, were bringing food on donkeys and camels, on mules and oxen—provisions of flour and cakes of figs and cakes of raisins, wine and oil and oxen and sheep abundantly, for "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "there was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " joy in Israel."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}